Register the ETH2SpecTec lcli subcommands.

sanity-slots, epoch-processing and operation cover the consensus-spec-tests
suites that transition-blocks alone cannot reach. Their implementations live in
lcli/src/{sanity_slots,epoch_processing,operation}.rs, copied in alongside this
patch (see modified_code/lighthouse/), so the module declarations this patch
adds have something to resolve to.

Each subcommand takes --post-state-output-path: differential testing needs the
post state written out for comparison, whereas upstream's runners check against
a state that is already known.
